  "visual": {
    "visualType": "textbox",
    "objects": {
      "general": [
        {
          "properties": {
            "paragraphs": [
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Know the figures",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Segoe UI Semibold",
                      "fontSize": "16pt",
                      "color": "#0A1E32"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": " ",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Segoe UI",
                      "fontSize": "6pt",
                      "color": "#0A1E32"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "• Turnover is the BSC turnover: Oasis resignations for hospitals 1 to 5, Fusion voluntary leavers for hospitals 6 to 8. Leaver figures marked in Fusion count Fusion leavers only.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Segoe UI",
                      "fontSize": "13pt",
                      "color": "#0A1E32"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": " ",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Segoe UI",
                      "fontSize": "6pt",
                      "color": "#0A1E32"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "• Promotions are the Fusion PROMOTION action (HR to confirm).",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Segoe UI",
                      "fontSize": "13pt",
                      "color": "#0A1E32"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": " ",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Segoe UI",
                      "fontSize": "6pt",
                      "color": "#0A1E32"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "• FTE equals headcount today: Fusion records an FTE of 1 for almost everyone, and a zero FTE is replaced by 1.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Segoe UI",
                      "fontSize": "13pt",
                      "color": "#0A1E32"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": " ",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Segoe UI",
                      "fontSize": "6pt",
                      "color": "#0A1E32"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "• Pay by grade uses each person's grade in the month's headcount; pay of people without one is left out.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Segoe UI",
                      "fontSize": "13pt",
                      "color": "#0A1E32"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": " ",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Segoe UI",
                      "fontSize": "6pt",
                      "color": "#0A1E32"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "• Leave balances come from Fusion absence plans. Where Fusion has none for a person and month, Oasis gives it: the annual leave earned in the current contract minus the leave taken against it.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Segoe UI",
                      "fontSize": "13pt",
                      "color": "#0A1E32"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": " ",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Segoe UI",
                      "fontSize": "6pt",
                      "color": "#0A1E32"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "• Vacancy rate: open requisitions divided by the budgeted FTE of the year. It reads No budgeted FTE until the budget is loaded.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Segoe UI",
                      "fontSize": "13pt",
                      "color": "#0A1E32"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": " ",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Segoe UI",
                      "fontSize": "6pt",
                      "color": "#0A1E32"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "• Story rates show 2 decimals; the largest change names the branch that moved most.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Segoe UI",
                      "fontSize": "13pt",
                      "color": "#0A1E32"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": " ",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Segoe UI",
                      "fontSize": "6pt",
                      "color": "#0A1E32"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "• Unknown means the record names no department, job, grade or other item.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Segoe UI",
                      "fontSize": "13pt",
                      "color": "#0A1E32"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": " ",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Segoe UI",
                      "fontSize": "6pt",
                      "color": "#0A1E32"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "• Data quality is rebuilt nightly, so a fix at the source shows the next day.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Segoe UI",
                      "fontSize": "13pt",
                      "color": "#0A1E32"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": " ",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Segoe UI",
                      "fontSize": "6pt",
                      "color": "#0A1E32"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "• Questions or a target to change: contact the BI manager.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Segoe UI",
                      "fontSize": "13pt",
                      "color": "#0A1E32"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": " ",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Segoe UI",
                      "fontSize": "6pt",
                      "color": "#0A1E32"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
